  ('vendor-apple', 'Apple Official Store', 'apple-official', 'Official Apple flagship storefront. iPhone, Mac, iPad, Apple Watch, AirPods, and genuine accessories with full manufacturer warranty.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611186871348-b1ce696e52c9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=200&q=80', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519389950473-47ba0277781c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80', 4.98, 4820, 0.05, 'active'),
